<title>USA: NEW YORK PHYSICAL COPPER MARKET - AUG 6.</title>
<headline>NEW YORK PHYSICAL COPPER MARKET - AUG 6.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Based on COMEX settlement prices, merchant copper cathodes for August shipment were quoted at a nominal 108.45 to 108.70 cents a lb.</p>
<p>Dealers quoted No.2 scrap copper at a nominal 85.00 cents per lb, up 1.00 cent from August 5th. ((New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640))</p>
